<title>USA: Donnkenny auditor resigns.</title>
<headline>Donnkenny auditor resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donnkenny Inc said on Wednesday that KPMG Peat Marwick resigned as the company's auditors and has been replaced by Deloitte and Touche LLP.</p>
<p>The reason for the resignation was not immediately available.</p>
<p>The company also said it named Stewart Levy as the company's new chief financial officer, effective November 4, 1996. The company has reassigned its controller and assistant controller to non-financial responsibilities.  </p>
<p>Donnkenny said Levy was most recently chief financial officer and vice president of Xpedite Systems Inc.</p>
<p>It could not immediately be determined if the chief financial officer's post was newly created or if Levy was replacing someone.</p>
